flowchart TD
    Dev((Developer))
    Repo[(Source Repository)]
    CI[CI Server]
    Lint[Lint Stage]
    UnitTest[Unit Test Stage]
    Build[Build Stage]
    ImageRegistry[(Container Registry)]
    SecurityScan[Security Scan Stage]
    IntegrationTest[Integration Test Stage]
    ArtifactStore[(Artifact Store)]
    CD[CD Server]
    StagingEnv[Staging Environment]
    ApprovalGate{Manual Approval}
    ProdEnv[Production Environment]
    Monitoring[Monitoring Service]
    NotifyService[Notification Service]

    Dev -->|push commit| Repo
    Repo -->|trigger webhook| CI
    CI -->|run| Lint
    Lint -->|passed| UnitTest
    UnitTest -->|passed| Build
    Build -->|push image| ImageRegistry
    Build -->|trigger| SecurityScan
    SecurityScan -->|passed| IntegrationTest
    ImageRegistry -->|pull image| IntegrationTest
    IntegrationTest -->|passed| ArtifactStore
    ArtifactStore -->|trigger deploy| CD
    CD -->|deploy| StagingEnv
    StagingEnv -->|request promotion| ApprovalGate
    ApprovalGate -->|approved| CD
    CD -->|deploy| ProdEnv
    ProdEnv -->|report health| Monitoring
    Monitoring -->|alert on failure| NotifyService
    CI -->|report status| NotifyService
